{"id":800,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield"],"text":"It needs light to survive, and it goes on a rampage seeking it out. Its laser beams will cut anything to pieces."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"It survives by absorbing light. After a long time spent slumbering underground, impurities accumulated within it, causing its body to darken."},{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"Light is the source of its energy. If it isn’t devouring light, impurities build up in it and on it, and Necrozma darkens and stops moving."},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"It looks somehow pained as it rages around in search of light, which serves as its energy. It’s apparently from another world."},{"games":["Moon"],"text":"Light is apparently the source of its energy. It has an extraordinarily vicious disposition and is constantly firing off laser beams."},{"games":["Sun"],"text":"Reminiscent of the Ultra Beasts, this life-form, apparently asleep underground, is thought to have come from another world in ancient times."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Prism Armor","hidden":false,"description":"Reduces the power of supereffective attacks taken."}],"eggGroups":["Undiscovered"],"genderRate":-1,"hatchCounter":120,"baseHappiness":0,"growthRate":"slow","habitat":null,"color":"Black","shape":"Arms","evolution":{"id":800,"name":"Necrozma","condition":null,"children":[]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[1,93],[1,232],[1,234],[1,236],[1,451],[8,446],[16,163],[24,400],[32,427],[40,500],[48,350],[56,334],[64,408],[72,722],[80,356],[88,711]],"machine":[332,34,280,523,347,451,399,349,406,414,89,203,797,263,430,374,248,416,356,360,257,63,304,286,334,442,282,113,232,800,200,408,182,94,706,473,115,156,350,157,317,201,184,421,214,684,76,446,444,500,164,241,129,14,851,168,433,404],"egg":[],"tutor":[]},"cards":[{"id":"swsh5-63","name":"Necrozma V","set":"Battle Styles","date":"2021-03-19","rarity":"Rare Holo V","number":"63","artist":"PLANETA Tsuji","img":"swsh5/63"},{"id":"swsh5-149","name":"Necrozma V","set":"Battle S